	(text "PGA2350: RP2350B + 16MB flash + 8MB PSRAM (PSRAM CS = GP47 on the module; leave GP47 free).\nModule is fed from VBUS (5V); its own 3V3 regulator powers the RP2350.\nRUN pull-up goes to the module's own 3V3 (pin 59) so RUN never back-feeds an unpowered module.\nThis sheet is used twice: MCU Master and MCU Slave (slave RUN is also driven by master GP43).\nDEBUG: JST-SH 3 pin, same pinout as FRANK PGA / Core2 (1 SWDIO, 2 GND, 3 SWCLK).\nPlace C (10u + 100n) close to the VBUS pin of the module."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 163.83 188.595 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
